le.</h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">The 30-day protocol behind the Little Brain Crew. One week for each part of your kid’s brain: sleep, screens and focus, meltdowns and hunger, moving and connecting. One 3-minute cartoon and one 10-minute habit a day, with the exact words to say. No pills. No lectures. No 300-page book.</p>\n      <div class=\"offer-buy\">\n        <span class=\"big\">$39 <span class=\"price-old\" data-early style=\"font-size:28px\">$59</span></span>\n        <span class=\"per\">one payment · about $1.30 a day · yours to keep</span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-main btn-lg\" type=\"button\" disabled>Coming soon</button>\n        <span class=\"fine\">Opening soon.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec lazy-sec s-white\" id=\"program\" data-c=\"var(--endo)\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"center-head\"><h2>What changes, week by week</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Each week, one part of the crew gets your attention, and one or two villains get beaten. Each day: one short cartoon, one small habit, done in the life you already have.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"surface\" style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:var(--r-l);padding:var(--s5) var(--s3);box-shadow:var(--sh-1)\">\n      <div class=\"journey\" data-reveal>\n        <svg class=\"path\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 10C120 2 240 18 360 10S600 2 720 10 900 18 1000 10\"/></svg>\n        <div class=\"stop\" style=\"--c:#8C9EEB\"><div class=\"dot\" data-char=\"mela\"><svg class=\"ch ch-mela \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"72\" r=\"34\" fill=\"#8C9EEB\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M24 58Q34 22 70 22Q100 24 108 60Q98 52 88 54Q60 38 24 58Z\" fill=\"#C5B4F5\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M38 40l4 6M58 30l2 7M78 30l-1 7\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"108\" cy=\"62\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FFD84D\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M38 78q8-8 16 0M66 78q8-8 16 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"88\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"88\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><path d=\"M48 90q12 11 24 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M84 96a8 8 0 1 0 8-12a6 6 0 1 1-8 12z\" fill=\"#FFD84D\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg></div><div><span class=\"wk\">Days 1–7 · sleep</span><h3>Mela on time, Corti in the morning</h3><p>Beat Glo and Bedi: dim lights, screens off an hour before bed (phones out of the bedroom for older kids), the same bedtime, daylight first thing.</p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"stop\" style=\"--c:var(--dopa)\"><div class=\"dot\" data-char=\"dopa\"><svg class=\"ch ch-dopa \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><path d=\"M60 10l5.5 11.5 12.5 1.8-9 8.8 2.1 12.4L60 38.6l-11.1 5.9 2.1-12.4-9-8.8 12.5-1.8z\" fill=\"#FF5A36\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"74\" r=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD84D\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"eyes\"><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"68\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"68\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"47.5\" cy=\"69\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"69\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/></g><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><path d=\"M48 84q12 10.8 24 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M24 78q-10-8-6-20M96 78q10-8 6-20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g></svg></div><div><span class=\"wk\">Days 8–14 · screens and focus</span><h3>Screens off, spotlight on</h3><p>With Dopa and Nora. Beat Lupi and Pingi: two warnings, autoplay off, and short blocks for homework (or clean-up and puzzles for little ones).</p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"stop\" style=\"--c:#E89AC7\"><div class=\"dot\" data-char=\"migo\"><svg class=\"ch ch-migo \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><path d=\"M60 28C88 32 100 62 90 88C82 108 38 108 30 88C20 62 32 32 60 28Z\" fill=\"#E89AC7\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"47\" y=\"24\" width=\"26\" height=\"7\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#B9B2A6\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M51 24q9-18 18 0z\" fill=\"#FF5A36\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M40 8l6 7M80 8l-6 7M60 0v7\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"eyes\"><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"66\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"66\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"47.5\" cy=\"67\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"67\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/></g><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"78\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"78\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"86\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/></g></svg></div><div><span class=\"wk\">Days 15–21 · meltdowns and hunger</span><h3>Calm Migo, build Fronti</h3><p>With Migo, Fronti, Greli and Gabi. The 60-second plan, waiting games, a snack before any question.</p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"stop\" style=\"--c:var(--endo)\"><div class=\"dot\" data-char=\"endo\"><svg class=\"ch ch-endo \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><path d=\"M30 40l-10-18M90 40l10-18\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"64\" rx=\"32\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#A8E6C8\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"eyes\"><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"54\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"54\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"47.5\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/></g><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"66\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"66\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><path d=\"M46 70q14 18 28 0z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><ellipse cx=\"44\" cy=\"108\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"6\" fill=\"#FF5A36\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><ellipse cx=\"76\" cy=\"108\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"6\" fill=\"#FF5A36\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g></svg></div><div><span class=\"wk\">Days 22–30 · move and connect</span><h3>Run, laugh, stay close</h3><p>With Endo, Toci, Sero and you. Wild play in the afternoon, screen-free dinners, 10 minutes just you two. Day 30: your family’s own code.</p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"stop\" style=\"--c:var(--teo)\"><div class=\"dot\" data-char=\"teo\"><svg class=\"ch ch-teo \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><rect x=\"24\" y=\"30\" width=\"72\" height=\"76\" rx=\"24\" fill=\"#BFE6FF\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"40\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#FF5A36\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 46l12-6M96 46l12 4\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"eyes\"><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"66\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"66\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"47.5\" cy=\"67\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"67\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/></g><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"78\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"78\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><path d=\"M48 84q12 9 24 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M24 80q-14-2-14-16M10 64h-6v-8h18v8h-6\" fill=\"#FFD84D\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g></svg></div><div><span class=\"wk\">Ages 13–17</span><h3>Teen track</h3><p>With Teo. Sleep, sport, phones at night and confidence, in words a teen will actually listen to.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec lazy-sec s-plain\" id=\"stack\" data-c=\"var(--dopa)\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:900px\">\n    <div class=\"center-head\"><h2>Everything you get</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Every piece is there to take one problem off your plate.</p></div>\n    <ul class=\"value-stack\" data-reveal>\n      <li><b>30 short cartoon lessons, 3 minutes each</b><span>So you’re not reading parenting books at midnight. Watch it while the pasta boils.</span></li>\n      <li><b>One habit a day, with the exact words to say</b><span>So you don’t have to work out what to do or how to say it. Just try today’s one thing.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Kid versions of every cartoon</b><span>So your kid gets the crew too, and “Dopa needs a warning” replaces the fight.</span></li>\n      <li><b>The science, in one sentence a day</b><span>So you know why each habit works, not just what to do. Every day names the crew member and the source behind it.</span></li>\n      <li><b>The 30-day fridge tracker</b><span>So the whole family sees the streak, and nobody has to remember.</span></li>\n      <li><b>The teen bonus with Teo (ages 13–17)</b><span>So the habits keep fitting as your kid grows into the teen years.</span></li>\n      <li><b>The Kid Brain Toolkit and all its bonuses, included</b><span>The whole crew, the 12 hardest moments, the villains, what’s normal at every age, with sources. $9 on its own.</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"per-day\"><span class=\"big\">$39</span><span class=\"eq\">÷ 30 days ≈</span><span class=\"big\">$1.30</span><span class=\"eq\">a day</span></div>\n    <p style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:var(--s4)\"><button class=\"btn btn-main btn-lg\" type=\"button\" disabled>Coming soon</button></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec lazy-sec s-plain\" id=\"fit\" data-c=\"var(--sero)\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"fit\">\n      <div class=\"surface fit-yes\"><h3>This is for you if…</h3>\n        <ul><li>The same 2 or 3 fights happen in your house every day</li><li>You want small habits, not a whole new parenting style</li><li>You can give it 10 minutes a day</li><li>You’d like your kid to understand what’s going on, too</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"surface fit-no\"><h3>It’s not for you if…</h3>\n        <ul><li>You’re looking for a diagnosis or a pill. We don’t do either.</li><li>Something about your child’s health worries you. Call your pediatrician first.</li><li>You want everything to change overnight</li></ul></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec lazy-sec s-white\" id=\"guide\" data-c=\"var(--dopa)\">\n  <div class=\"wrap guide-grid\">\n    <div class=\"fan\" data-reveal aria-label=\"Preview of pages from the Toolkit\" role=\"img\">\n      <div class=\"pg\"><div class=\"cov\"><small>Little Brain Crew · toolkit</small><h4>The Kid Brain Toolkit</h4><div data-char=\"dopa\" style=\"width:70%;margin:0 auto\"><svg class=\"ch ch-dopa \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><path d=\"M60 10l5.5 11.5 12.5 1.8-9 8.8 2.1 12.4L60 38.6l-11.1 5.9 2.1-12.4-9-8.8 12.5-1.8z\" fill=\"#FF5A36\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"74\" r=\"36\" fill=\"#FFD84D\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"eyes\"><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"68\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"68\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"47.5\" cy=\"69\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/><circle cx=\"75.5\" cy=\"69\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#1B1A33\"/></g><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"80\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#FF8FA8\" opacity=\".7\"/><path d=\"M48 84q12 10.8 24 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M24 78q-10-8-6-20M96 78q10-8 6-20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1B1A33\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g></svg></div><small>The 6 characters behind your kid’s mood</small></div></div>\n      <div class=\"pg\"><small>Crew member 1 of 12</small><h4>Meet Dopa</h4><div data-char=\"dopa\" data-mood=\"happy\" style=\"width:56%;margin:0 auto\"><svg class=\"ch ch-dopa \" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"bob\"><path d=\"M