oin=\"round\"/></g></svg></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"pg\"><small>Checklist</small><h4>Tonight’s 3 habits</h4><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"box\"></span>Warn at 5 and 1 minute</div><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"box\"></span>Screens off 1 hour before bed</div><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"box\"></span>10 minutes, just you two</div><div class=\"ln\"></div><div class=\"ln s\"></div><div class=\"ln\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"kick\">not ready for 30 days?</span>\n      <h2>Start with the $9 Toolkit.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin:12px 0 16px\">The science of your kid’s brain in one evening: the whole crew, the 12 hardest moments, the villains, and what’s normal at every age, with the research behind it.</p>\n      <div class=\"deliver\"><span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-mail\"/></svg>Digital PDF, by email once we open</span></div>\n      <ol class=\"toc\">\n        <li><span>How the code works: the two rules (Plasti and Duo)</span><em>p. –</em></li>\n        <li><span>Meet the crew: 12 messengers, hormones and brain parts</span><em>p. –</em></li>\n        <li><span>The 12 hardest moments, decoded</span><em>p. –</em></li>\n        <li><span>The 6 villains and how to beat them</span><em>p. –</em></li>\n        <li><span>What’s normal now: Whyzi to Seki</span><em>p. –</em></li>\n        <li><span>Sources</span><em>p. –</em></li>\n        <li><span>Bonuses: 24 script cards, the 60-Second Meltdown Plan, the poster, crew cartoons</span><em>link</em></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"fine\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">If you upgrade to the 30-Day Reset later, your $9 counts toward it.</p>\n      <button class=\"btn \" type=\"button\" disabled>Coming soon</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec lazy-sec s-plain\" id=\"club\" data-c=\"var(--teo)\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"center-head\"><span class=\"kick\">after day 30</span><h2>Keep the crew around.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">The community where the code keeps growing. A new crew member every month, your questions answered by the crew, and parents doing the same thing, so the habits you built don’t slide back.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"plans\">\n      <div class=\"plan best\" style=\"--c:var(--teo)\">\n        <span class=\"step\">Membership</span>\n        <h3 class=\"serif-h\">The Crew Club</h3>\n        <div class=\"club-faces\" data-faces></div>\n        <div class=\"bill\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Billing\"><button type=\"button\" data-bill=\"m\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Monthly</button><button type=\"button\" data-bill=\"y\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Yearly</button></div>\n        <span class=\"big\" id=\"club-price\">$19<small>/month</small></span>\n        <span class=\"per\" id=\"club-save\">about $0.63 a day</span>\n        <ul><li>A new crew member every month, from our map of 156</li><li>A monthly Q&amp;A episode: your questions, answered by the crew</li><li>A private community of parents doing the same thing</li><li>Ages &amp; stages guides as your kid grows</li><li>A family challenge and bedtime stories every month</li><li>Pause or cancel yourself, in 2 clicks</li></ul>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-main\" id=\"club-cta\" type=\"button\" disabled>Coming soon</button>\n        <span class=\"fine\">Opening soon.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"compare-hint\">swipe the table →</p>\n    <div class=\"compare\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Compare the Toolkit, the program and the Crew Club\" tabindex=\"0\">\n      <table>\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Compare</th><th scope=\"col\">Toolkit</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"hl\">30-Day Reset</th><th scope=\"col\">Crew Club</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Price</td><td>$9 once</td><td class=\"hl\">$39 once</td><td>$19 a month or $199 a year</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>The 12-member crew, villains, ages and stages</td><td class=\"y\">✓</td><td class=\"hl y\">✓</td><td class=\"n\">–</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>12 hard moments decoded, script cards, meltdown plan</td><td class=\"y\">✓</td><td class=\"hl y\">✓</td><td class=\"n\">–</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>30-day protocol: a cartoon and a habit a day</td><td class=\"n\">–</td><td class=\"hl y\">✓</td><td class=\"n\">–</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Kid versions and the fridge tracker</td><td class=\"n\">–</td><td class=\"hl y\">✓</td><td class=\"n\">–</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Teen track with Teo</td><td class=\"n\">–</td><td class=\"hl y\">✓</td><td class=\"n\">–</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>A new crew member every month</td><td class=\"n\">–</td><td class=\"hl n\">–</td><td class=\"y\">✓</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Monthly Q&amp;A, parent community, bedtime stories</td><td class=\"n\">–</td><td class=\"hl n\">–</td><td class=\"y\">✓</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec lazy-sec s-white\" id=\"faq\" data-c=\"var(--teo)\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:24px\">Questions before you start</h2>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <details><summary>How do I get it?</summary><p>Once we open, you’ll get an email with your link right after you pay. Watch on your phone, tablet or TV. Nothing to install.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>How much time does it take?</summary><p>About 10 minutes a day: one short cartoon and one small habit. Miss a day? Just pick up where you left off.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Is it a subscription?</summary><p>No. The Toolkit and the 30-Day Reset are one payment, and they’re yours to keep. Only the Crew Club is monthly or yearly, and you can pause or cancel it yourself.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Can I get a refund?</summary><p>Once we open, you get instant access to digital content, so all sales will be final. If something doesn’t work, like a link or a file that won’t open, email us and we’ll fix it fast. The Crew Club is different: pause or cancel it yourself, anytime, in 2 clicks.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Is this medical advice?</summary><p>No. It’s learning for parents, built on everyday habits. We don’t diagnose, treat or promise results. If something worries you, call your pediatrician first.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Can I give it as a gift?</summary><p>Yes. <a href=\"/gift\">Send it as a gift</a> and they get a card by email on the day you pick.</p></details>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec s-plain\" data-c=\"var(--endo)\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-box surface\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <h3>30 days from now, the evenings can look different.</h3>\n      <p>Ten minutes a day. One small habit at a time. Opening soon.</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-main btn-lg\" type=\"button\" disabled>Coming soon</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-foot\" id=\"site-foot\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"logo\" aria-label=\"Little Brain Crew home\"><img class=\"logo-img\" src=\"/assets/brand/lbc-logo-horizontal-white.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"48\"></a>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:12px;max-width:340px\">The crew inside your kid’s brain, made simple. <a href=\"mailto:hello@littlebraincrew.com\" style=\"color:#fff\">hello@littlebraincrew.com</a></p>\n      <a href=\"/support\" class=\"support-link\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">♥</span> Support the crew · soon</a>\n    </div>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/#plans\">Plans</a><a href=\"/pricing\">The 30-Day Reset</a><a href=\"/pricing#club\">Crew Club</a><a href=\"/ask\">Ask the crew</a><a href=\"/free\">Free tips &amp; stickers</a><a href=\"/gift\">Give it as a gift</a><a href=\"/shop\">Shop</a><a href=\"/schools\">For schools</a><a href=\"/founding\">Founding parents</a><a href=\"/affiliate\">Affiliate program</a><a href=\"/faq\">Parent FAQ</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy